00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.520
and also potentially escalating back to human for review.

421
00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:40.480
So it has the ability to say, hey, I need context,

422
00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:43.440
can pause everything and go post that question

